# Crystl working state is local-only: session caches, quest scratch, worktree bookkeeping.
*

# …except project-local heroes. These are generated from design-team/roster.md and are
# meant to travel with the repo — crystl loads them per-project and carries them into
# every isolated worktree, so they have to be committed to work as intended.
!.gitignore
!heroes/
!heroes/*.json
